+### Presentation
+
+Views are Thymeleaf templates under `src/main/resources/templates`, grouped by feature and composed through one shared layout fragment. Every user-facing string comes from the message bundles, and a build-time test walks the templates to prove no bundle is missing a key. Expression output is escaped by default and the application does not disable it.
